ow and then to recover those hit points!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/header_trainer.gif?t=1743698524\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/footage_trainer.gif?t=1743698524\" />Select from diverse trainers, each with a unique playstyle. Do you wanna put your team in the perfect position, get right up in their faces and duke it out, or buff up your Montabi with a hearty meal? When the city's at stake, everyone pitches in! Just make sure to stay safe! Like the king in chess, if your trainer is defeated, the game ends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/header_montabi.gif?t=1743698524\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/extras/footage_montabi.gif?t=1743698524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ Montabi planned for release, each with a unique and distinct playstyle. Choose your favorite!</p>","developers":["Mankibo"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/f24804132fb63b1579bd60c2c04ba94f2fec6786/header.jpg?t=1743698524","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117236,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117236/movie480.mp4?t=1743695852","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117236/movie_max.