item_assets/steam/apps/3141630/ss_93400f6281d367e8541eb3ae76b8771f86a23031.600x338.jpg?t=1743698524"}],"short_description":"A Creature-Collector Roguelike Deckbuilder where you build your deck by taming and assembling a team of Montabi. Engage in thrilling turn-based battles, strategically utilizing their unique abilities. Assemble a synergistic team and you just might save the city from evil!","steam_appid":3141630,"support_info":{"email":"hello@mankibo.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://mankibo.com/games/"}